# Icon Style - Outlined + Adaptive

Use outlined icons throughout the app and route icon selection through adaptive helpers.

## Rules

- **Use adaptive icons**: Prefer `AppIcon`/adaptive icon wrappers from `lib/platform/`
- **Use outlined icons**: Prefer outlined variants over filled variants
- **No filled icons**: Avoid `_fill` suffix icons except for the allowed exceptions below
- **Exception – Validation**: Form validation icons (error/success) should remain filled for visibility
- **Exception – Selected nav tabs**: Selected tabs may use filled variants for platform conventions

## Examples

```dart
// ❌ BAD - hard-coding platform-specific icons in feature screens
CupertinoIcons.person_fill
CupertinoIcons.chat_bubble_fill
CupertinoIcons.camera_fill
CupertinoIcons.location_fill
CupertinoIcons.person_2_fill

// ✅ GOOD - outlined + adaptive
CupertinoIcons.person
CupertinoIcons.chat_bubble
CupertinoIcons.camera
CupertinoIcons.location
CupertinoIcons.person_2

// ✅ EXCEPTION - validation icons stay filled
CupertinoIcons.checkmark_circle_fill  // Success state
CupertinoIcons.exclamationmark_circle_fill  // Error state
```

## Common Icon Mappings

| Filled (Don't use) | Outlined (Use instead) |
|-------------------|------------------------|
| `person_fill` | `person` |
| `person_2_fill` | `person_2` |
| `chat_bubble_fill` | `chat_bubble` |
| `chat_bubble_text_fill` | `chat_bubble_text` |
| `camera_fill` | `camera` |
| `location_fill` | `location` |
| `heart_fill` | `heart` |
| `star_fill` | `star` |
